<!-- table:stage-gate-2.criteria role=labels key=Criterion -->

## Criteria

| Criterion | Standard | Status | Evidence | To close | Owner |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **The system works** | Meets the acceptance threshold on the held-out slice with **zero silent failures** — everything below confidence routes to the gate | | | | |
| **The evidence exists** | Eval report with a failure taxonomy · audit trail demonstrable on **any run the reviewer picks** · regression gate **blocks a deliberately broken change** | | | | |
| **The judgment is defensible** | Allocation grid **survives challenge** · the **declines are argued convincingly** · the cost envelope is **arithmetic rather than hope** | | | | |

Three of these are adversarial and must be rehearsed, not assumed: *any run the reviewer picks*, *a deliberately broken change*, and *survives challenge*.

